Z||000007||aka||08-15-2001||12:01 AM||||My best race was actually against another Fiero.  I pulled up behind an 87 GT and got into the lane beside him.  He gave me the nod and off the line we both hit really well.  I pulled ahead by the top of second gear and thats about when we hit both the speed limit and another red light.  Pulled into a gas station and talked about our cars.  I rack the win to my engine, only 10,000 miles on my rebuild.||||reg||1
